Third-party data and libraries
------------------------------

### National Weather Service / NOAA
Forecast, observation, alert, and related weather data are provided by the
U.S. National Weather Service and NOAA through publicly documented services
(e.g. weather.gov MapClick, api.weather.gov, radar.weather.gov, CO-OPS tides
and water levels, NHC tropical cyclone products, SPC storm reports).

This application is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NOAA,
the National Weather Service, or the U.S. Department of Commerce.

Please use government APIs responsibly (reasonable User-Agent, caching, and
rate of requests).

